 "changelog": "Everything reacts at once now. A scan no longer grinds through a slow deep check in the middle of scanning: when the quick look cannot settle a spot, that deep check happens in the background where it belongs, so scanning stays fast and even. The button detector also warms up when the app opens, so the very first scan is already at full speed. A button that appears is found within a moment, and the moment one button is done the app is ready for the next - no more five to ten second pauses at the start, between buttons, or after a long quiet stretch.",
